DESCRIPTION:FormBuilder Multi-Tenant Architecture Implementation\n\nPhase 1 (3-4 hours): Database & Multi-Tenancy Setup\n- Set up PostgreSQL database with multi-tenant schema\n- Create tenants table with subscription tiers\n- Add Row-Level Security (RLS)\n- Implement API key management system\n- Run Prisma migrations\n\nPhase 2 (2-3 hours): Tenant Middleware & Context\n- Build tenant detection middleware (subdomain/custom domain)\n- Create TenantProvider React context\n- Implement dynamic branding system\n- Set up Redis-based rate limiting\n\nPhase 3 (2-3 hours): Basic SDK Foundation\n- Build FormBuilderClient class\n- Create FormsResource and ResponsesResource\n- Add TypeScript type definitions\n- Write SDK tests and examples\n\nSuccess Metrics:\n✅ Multi-tenant database schema operational\n✅ Tenant routing working\n✅ API key authentication functional\n✅ Basic SDK client ready\n✅ Rate limiting active\n✅ Test tenants created
